; Cranelisp Ring 4R — Sprint 60: Clean & Green — JIT/object convergence + observability

; Sprint 60 frames five S59 carries under one invariant: same source MUST
; produce the same code bytes across JIT direct-finalize and .o-relocation
; paths. Closing that divergence cleared the carry cluster; alongside it a
; handful of high-value FIXMEs landed — CLIF dump, cache build marker,
; /sig docstring format, and captured-variable RC contract.

; Workstream G — /sig for a docstring'd defn now renders the universal
; spec §1.1 line: `:Type name ; classification - docstring`. Prior to S60
; the dash and docstring were omitted on the /sig path.

(defn double "Double an integer." [:Int x] (+ x x))

/sig double

; Workstream A — JIT/object convergence. The S59 carries bundled a family
; of defects where a captured heap value or polymorphic dispatch compiled
; one way under JIT finalize and a different way under .o + relocation.
; The most visible shape was a lambda closing over a let-bound value,
; called inside the same let body. Now one code path, one RC contract.

(let [factor 10] (let [scale (fn [:Int x] (* x factor))] (scale 7)))

; Workstream B — CLIF-dump observability. `/clif <name>` prints the
; Cranelift IR for a defn so the shrunk repro can be inspected by eye —
; load-bearing during S60 root-causing, and now permanent.

/clif double

; Workstream C — object-file build marker. The cache `manifest.json` now
; carries a `compiler_mtime` derived at build time; a rebuilt compiler
; rejects stale `.o` artefacts automatically. No more mystery staleness
; after a `cargo build`.

/sh printf '(defn triple [:Int x] (+ x (+ x x)))\n' > mathlib.cl

(import [mathlib [triple]])

(triple 14)

/quit

; Restart — the fresh session restores user.cl, rehydrates `mathlib`
; from cache, and the cross-module call (JIT path + .o-relocation path
; share one register_module recursion per S59) returns in one prompt.
; The cache manifest, flushed on session end, now carries `compiler_mtime`.

/sh grep compiler_mtime .cranelisp-cache/manifest.json

(triple 100)

; Sprint 60 closes: 5 carry failures flipped green, one invariant
; ("same source → same code bytes") restored across JIT and object
; codegen, CLIF dump permanent, cache build-marker in place, /sig
; format conforms to repl/spec.md §1.1. Path clear for Sprint 61's
; FQTypeName migration.
